      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nIt happened again today, so I'm attaching the relevant portion of the log.\n\n- I was originally using the 「ひかるん（avtr_78c...）」 avatar.\n\n- 05:35:19: I attempted to switch to 「シンシア（avtr_fe8...）」.\n\n- 05:35:24: After waiting about five seconds for it to load, the avatar never appeared. Instead, I received a notification saying that my avatar had been changed to 「ひかるん（avtr_78c...）」.\n\n- 05:35:26: Rather than the avatar I had attempted to switch to, 「ひかるん（avtr_78c...）」, which I had originally been using, was displayed again.\n\n- 05:35:59: I attempted to switch to 「シンシア（avtr_fe8...）」 again.\n\n- 05:36:00: I don't remember whether it took exactly one second, but this time the avatar switched successfully to 「シンシア（avtr_fe8...）」.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
